{"4527130": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Launch Them All", "steam_appid": 4527130, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4527130/extras/19e8dd557e5f57b236565dba765d8133.avif?t=1788283837\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4527130/extras_big/19e8dd557e5f57b236565dba765d8133.avif?t=1788283837 width=1560 height=780 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A New Spin on an Old Classic</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Launch Them All is a <strong><u>Cold-War-inspired, turn-based strategy showdown</u></strong> where precision is the name of the game. Command your launch grid, gather intel, and outplay your opponent in a tense battle of missiles, deception, and risk.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4527130/extras/7d7a14c10e6af7ca4dd04baea6d6bb81.poster.avif?t=1788283837\" width=400 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4527130/extras/7d7a14c10e6af7ca4dd04baea6d6bb81.webm?t=1788283837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4527130/extras/7d7a14c10e6af7ca4dd04baea6d6bb81.mp4?t=1788283837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’ll place your silos, stockpiles, and civilian shelters, then fight to destroy enemy military assets before your enemy can do the same. Be aware, reckless fire has consequences: hit too many civilian shelters and you'd best prepare for your tribunal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4527130/extras/0fc8d5c31876b9507f8f7bb9eb07497f.avif?t=1788283837\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4527130/extras_big/0fc8d5c31876b9507f8f7bb9eb07497f.avif?t=1788283837 width=1560 height=536 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Better Get Your Strategy Hat On</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Three ways to play, against bots or with your friends:</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Arcade</strong></u>: Get into the action with minimal setup. Unlimited spies and randomized powerups every 5 turns. Quick matches.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Tactical</strong></u>: Manually control the placement of all your assets. Randomized powerups every 10 turns. Spies are limited. Expect more of a challenge in defeating your opponent. Also comes in an &quot;endless&quot; mode, for those who want a test of endurance...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Strategic</strong></u>: The true LTA experience. Manually place your assets and use a turn-based economy to acquire powerups during &quot;Buy Rounds&quot;. Spies are limited too, so make them count.</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4527130/extras/4178780fcebecfd23e5169090dcff989.poster.avif?t=1788283837\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4527130/extras/4178780fcebecfd23e5169090dcff989.webm?t=1788283837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4527130/extras/4178780fcebecfd23e5169090dcff989.mp4?t=1788283837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intel warfare:</strong> Use spy scans to track military targets, radiation clues, and civilian zones before you strike. A careful eye will clue into enemy locations before they ever know you're coming.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Eight tactical powerups:</strong> Augment your tactical capability through the use of Spy Planes, SAM Sites, Decoys, and more. Dunk on your enemies with a nuclear warhead and watch their morale sink!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High-stakes decision making:</strong> Win by eliminating enemy silos and stockpiles, while protecting civilians from collateral damage. Negligence will send you packing around here.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single-player and Steam Multiplayer:</strong> Face the AI or challenge other players online - hosted or matchmade.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Career progression:</strong> Track match stats, earn XP, and level up over time to earn player titles and additional customization.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every turn is a gamble. Gather intel, control the board, and launch at the perfect moment. And when all else fails, don't be afraid to Launch Them All!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4527130/extras/19e8dd557e5f57b236565dba765d8133.avif?t=1788283837\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4527130/extras_big/19e8dd557e5f57b236565dba765d8133.avif?t=1788283837 width=1560 height=780 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A New Spin on an Old Classic</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Launch Them All is a <strong><u>Cold-War-inspired, turn-based strategy showdown</u></strong> where precision is the name of the game. Command your launch grid, gather intel, and outplay your opponent in a tense battle of missiles, deception, and risk.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4527130/extras/7d7a14c10e6af7ca4dd04baea6d6bb81.poster.avif?t=1788283837\" width=400 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4527130/extras/7d7a14c10e6af7ca4dd04baea6d6bb81.webm?t=1788283837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4527130/extras/7d7a14c10e6af7ca4dd04baea6d6bb81.mp4?t=1788283837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’ll place your silos, stockpiles, and civilian shelters, then fight to destroy enemy military assets before your enemy can do the same. Be aware, reckless fire has consequences: hit too many civilian shelters and you'd best prepare for your tribunal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4527130/extras/0fc8d5c31876b9507f8f7bb9eb07497f.avif?t=1788283837\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4527130/extras_big/0fc8d5c31876b9507f8f7bb9eb07497f.avif?t=1788283837 width=1560 height=536 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Better Get Your Strategy Hat On</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Three ways to play, against bots or with your friends:</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Arcade</strong></u>: Get into the action with minimal setup. Unlimited spies and randomized powerups every 5 turns. Quick matches.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Tactical</strong></u>: Manually control the placement of all your assets. Randomized powerups every 10 turns. Spies are limited. Expect more of a challenge in defeating your opponent. Also comes in an &quot;endless&quot; mode, for those who want a test of endurance...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Strategic</strong></u>: The true LTA experience. Manually place your assets and use a turn-based economy to acquire powerups during &quot;Buy Rounds&quot;. Spies are limited too, so make them count.</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4527130/extras/4178780fcebecfd23e5169090dcff989.poster.avif?t=1788283837\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4527130/extras/4178780fcebecfd23e5169090dcff989.webm?t=1788283837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4527130/extras/4178780fcebecfd23e5169090dcff989.mp4?t=1788283837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intel warfare:</strong> Use spy scans to track military targets, radiation clues, and civilian zones before you strike. A careful eye will clue into enemy locations before they ever know you're coming.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Eight tactical powerups:</strong> Augment your tactical capability through the use of Spy Planes, SAM Sites, Decoys, and more. Dunk on your enemies with a nuclear warhead and watch their morale sink!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High-stakes decision making:</strong> Win by eliminating enemy silos and stockpiles, while protecting civilians from collateral damage. Negligence will send you packing around here.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single-player and Steam Multiplayer:</strong> Face the AI or challenge other players online - hosted or matchmade.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Career progression:</strong> Track match stats, earn XP, and level up over time to earn player titles and additional customization.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every turn is a gamble. Gather intel, control the board, and launch at the perfect moment. And when all else fails, don't be afraid to Launch Them All!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "A high-stakes turn-based missile duel where every shot matters. Spy, bluff, and deploy powerful tactical abilities to destroy enemy military assets while avoiding civilian casualties.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4527130/387f68c9a1b13c435265aa17bed8a43f48413be0/header.jpg?t=1788283837", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4527130/2ab4154b66414fa4b85ce0493230dea5284fbf32/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788283837", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4527130/2ab4154b66414fa4b85ce0493230dea5284fbf32/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788283837", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 3 3250U with integrated Graphics<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 2 GB AMD Radeon(TM) Graphics<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-10700K CPU<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Grap